  "notes": "Boot a Creature from the Black Lagoon ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released) and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled; the scenario names no game. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape, open the service menu, start T.5 FLASHER TEST and step it with Up past its wrap, taking three frames 0.35 s apart at every step because the selected name blinks. In repeat mode the ROM pulses the selected flasher and prints its own name, pairing each name with the public address PinMAME published. T.5 must pulse one of the candidate flasher addresses after it starts.",
  "version": 1,
  "watch_switches": [
